      "widgets_values": [
        "Edge-Aware Mask Refiner — snap a mask edge to the real edges of the photo.\n\nA deliberately soft mask (Sub-Pixel Mask Refiner with wide radii) is refined with the portrait as guide: the guided filter pulls the transition onto the hair and skin boundary. radius = size of the neighbourhood, eps = how strictly it follows image edges (smaller = tighter)."
